+        "One reduced nonnegative rational [a,1].  The numerator a is a multiple "
+        "of k! from 0 through the falling factorial |E|!/(|E|-k)!, inclusive."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
+        "json_shape": "[numerator, denominator]",
